{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12978","headline":"荅李滁州题庭前石竹花见寄 · 独孤及","name":"荅李滁州题庭前石竹花见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殷疑曙霞染，巧类匣刀裁。\n不怕南风热，能迎小暑开。\n游蜂怜色好，思妇感年催。\n览赠添离恨，愁肠日几廻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}